[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0709","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0789","title":"IBM AIX ftpd libc 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.2 操作系统 ftpd 服务所依赖的 libc 库在处理用户输入时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，根源在于未进行有效的边界长度检查，导致超长输入可覆盖栈内存。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务发送特制的超长参数触发溢出，破坏程序执行流程进而执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。攻击者只需能够访问目标 TCP 21 端口即可发起攻击，无需有效凭证，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0789"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 IBM AIX 至 4.3.3 或后续已修复版本，并向 IBM 申请安装针对该 ftpd/libc 缓冲区溢出的官方 APAR 补丁（如 IY01919 等系列）。若暂无法升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 ftp 行后执行 refresh -s inetd 临时禁用 ftpd 服务，或通过防火墙限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 21 端口作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-072.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/679","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19532","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0789.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8057fa2fdc38632692a6b3f836dd95e1eb8504fd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0789.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9ef5a1e2753195eb4be450895da310f7a8a6524e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0789.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-25cr-8qvj-rg6f/GHSA-25cr-8qvj-rg6f.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/aix_ftpd.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0789.json"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19532","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0789.md"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19532"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2008","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1576","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 4.0 中的 pdf.ocx ActiveX 控件（PDF.PdfCtrl.1）1.3.188 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向用户浏览器嵌入特制 PDF 文档并调用 pdf.setView 方法触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。受影响的系统需安装 Acrobat Reader 4.0 及该 ActiveX 控件，攻击者可构造恶意网页诱使用户访问实现远程控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1576"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader 至 4.0.5 及以上版本，该版本已修复 pdf.ocx 控件的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，在 Internet Explorer 中为受影响 ActiveX 控件（CLSID：CA8A9780-280D-11CF-A24D-444553540000）设置 kill bit，或禁用 ActiveX 控件执行权限。建议改用现代 PDF 阅读器替代。对于仍必须使用旧版的环境，将 IE 安全区域中\"ActiveX 控件和插件\"相关选项全部设为禁用或提示。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/25919","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/666","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3318","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19514","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1576.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1576","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1576.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1576.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cpp-p296-85wp/GHSA-6cpp-p296-85wp.json","https://github.com/buffer/phoneyc/blob/d566bd12e70da0ccd952e69e2b02922c7ab61797/ActiveX/modules/PDFsetview","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1576.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-2008.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-2008.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-2008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0737","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0737.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0940","title":"Mutt 邮件客户端 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"mutt 邮件客户端在处理特制的 MIME 消息时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意构造的 MIME 附件的电子邮件，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个版本的 mutt 邮件客户端，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0940"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:22Z","remediation":"立即将 mutt 升级到 0.95.7 及以上修复版本（1999 年官方补丁修复了 MIME 解析中的缓冲区溢出）。若暂时无法升级，可在邮件客户端配置中禁用自动执行外部 MIME 处理器、关闭 HTML/附件自动渲染，并改用 less 等安全查看器预览邮件以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0940","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0940.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aa3114da1227373bef7855dba21bcaa5f0e0ad76/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0940.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0940","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0940.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0940.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pm3w-22f3-8w8x/GHSA-pm3w-22f3-8w8x.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0940.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0737.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0522","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0788","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9125,\"outputTokens\":29,\"totalTokens\":10818}}","description":"Knox Software Arkeia 备份软件的 nlserverd 服务（4.0 与 4.1 版本）存在拒绝服务漏洞。该服务在处理远程客户端请求时未能正确校验输入，导致攻击者可通过向目标主机上 nlserverd 监听的端口发送特制的数据包触发异常，使服务崩溃或停止响应。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞对运行受影响版本的 Arkeia 服务器发起远程拒绝服务攻击，导致合法备份与管理操作中断，影响系统可用性。利用方式简单，无需认证且无需本地访问权限，仅需网络可达即可发送恶意请求。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0788"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:03Z","remediation":"建议升级 Knox Software Arkeia 至 4.2 及以上修复版本，或应用厂商针对 nlserverd 发布的安全补丁。如暂无法升级，可在防火墙或边界设备上过滤到达 5555 端口（nlserverd 服务端口）的非法/异常外部连接，仅允许受信任内部主机访问，以缓解远程拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93837184228248&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/662","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/19dfa989c2a07b8fd71870a139a7d171f621ff41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0788.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0788","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0788.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9ef5a1e2753195eb4be450895da310f7a8a6524e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0788.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-29xc-rhpj-gjp7/GHSA-29xc-rhpj-gjp7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/dos.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0788.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.193"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1909","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1484","title":"Microsoft MSN Messenger Service Setup BBS ActiveX 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MSN Setup BBS 4.71.0.10 ActiveX 控件（setupbbs.ocx）的 vAddNewsServer 和 bIsNewsServerConfigured 方法存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，向该方法传入超长参数触发溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft MSN Messenger Service 1.0 及其附带的 ActiveX 组件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。由于该组件已停止维护，建议用户卸载或禁用相关 ActiveX 控件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1484"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 MSN Setup BBS ActiveX 控件 (setupbbs.ocx) 的缓冲区溢出，建议立即卸载 MSN Messenger Service 1.0（该产品已停止支持），或在注册表中为 CLSID {B1B6A000-2A0C-11D2-8E2A-00C04F79E3AE} 设置 Kill Bit（将 Compatibility Flags 设为 0x400），禁用该 ActiveX 控件在 Internet Explorer 中的加载。同时建议升级到受支持的即时通讯产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/668","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3310","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19516","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/559e7878a2bcd153513c59154e730dfe23ee3b94/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1484.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1484","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1484.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1484.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7697-hr74-2qhh/GHSA-7697-hr74-2qhh.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/winmessenger_installed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1484.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000791.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1909.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1909.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1196","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1578","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Registration Wizard ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.01 及 5 版本中的 Registration Wizard ActiveX 控件（regwizc.dll，InvokeRegWizard 函数）3.0.0.0 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱使用户访问后触发该控件中的缓冲区溢出，从而在用户系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（访问恶意网页），CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1578"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Internet Explorer 4.01 和 5，建议升级到受支持的现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge 或最新版 IE 11）以彻底消除风险。若必须使用旧版 IE，请安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-037 提供的补丁，并通过设置 kill bit 禁用存在风险的 ActiveX 控件 regwizc.dll：在注册表 `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility\\{50E5E3D1-C07E-11D0-B9FD-00A0249F6B00}` 下创建 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值并设为 0x400（1024），以阻止该控件的实例化。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/37556","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/671","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3311","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19528","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1578.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1578","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1578.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1578.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wmp-mpx8-hrwf/GHSA-8wmp-mpx8-hrwf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1578.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000792.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fd4caeb6-7cb4-4970-80aa-36baa776bee5.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1196.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1196.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1068","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1351","title":"KVIrc IRC客户端目录遍历读取任意文件漏洞","description":"KVIrc IRC 客户端 0.9.0 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。当启用 \"Listen to !nick &lt;soundname&gt; requests\" 选项时，远程攻击者可通过向目标客户端发送特制的 DCC GET 请求，在请求路径中包含 \"../\" 序列实现目录穿越，从而读取任意文件。该漏洞影响 KVIrc 0.9.0 版本，危害等级中等，可能泄露敏感系统文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1351"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"升级 KVIrc 至 0.9.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复目录遍历问题。如无法升级，请在设置中关闭「Listen to !nick <soundname> requests」选项，或通过防火墙限制 IRC 客户端的 DCC 入站连接（默认端口 6667-6669）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93845560631314&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7761.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/