x/bin/nlservd /usr/knox/bin/rnavc。若不再使用该备份软件，建议彻底卸载 Knox Arkeia 软件包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93837184228248&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/661","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19511","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1534.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1534","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1534.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84a8576323536424cfe4fe56907ba66e1ea3a744/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1534.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w2cr-mhfx-9hr5/GHSA-w2cr-mhfx-9hr5.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/arkeia.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1534.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1126","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1477","title":"GNOME Libraries espeaker 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNOME 库 1.0.8 中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向使用 espeaker 功能的程序（如 nethack）传递超长的 --espeaker 参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Mandriva Linux Mandrake 6.0 及使用受影响 GNOME 库的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用前提是攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1477"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:31Z","remediation":"升级 GNOME 库至 1.0.9 及以上版本，或升级操作系统至 Mandriva Linux 更高发行版。对于现代系统，避免在 setuid 程序中直接传递用户可控参数给 espeaker 程序，并在编译时启用栈保护（-fstack-protector）以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28717","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/663","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3349","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19512","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1477.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1477","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1477.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1477.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8ccc79d89deeafda724629468f9e0f4c692fb770/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fm6-5ph4-2rpq/GHSA-6fm6-5ph4-2rpq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1477.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0863","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0863.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1013","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9135,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10816}}","description":"AIX named-xfer 组件存在文件覆盖漏洞，系统组成员可通过 -f 参数指定恶意构造的区域文件，利用 named-xfer 处理区域传输时的权限缺陷覆盖任意系统文件，进而实现本地提权至 root。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.1.5 和 4.2.1 版本，攻击者需具备系统组权限并能访问 named-xfer 程序，通过精心设计的畸形区域文件触发漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.2，属于高危本地提权漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1013"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:31Z","remediation":"建议升级 AIX 至 IBM 官方修复版本（4.3.2 或更高），或安装 IBM 针对 named-xfer 发布的 APAR 补丁（IX72659）。若无法立即升级，可移除 named-xfer 的 setuid/setgid 权限（chmod u-s,g-s /usr/sbin/named-xfer），并限制 system 组成员，禁止普通用户通过 -f 参数指定任意区域文件路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93837026726954&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/673","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e46881568ba1d1c2011ec61282a082880cda856/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1013","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1013.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/57cb981038a97031bd95a35a9b10bbed18ca4725/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1013.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-958c-wvqf-f46f/GHSA-958c-wvqf-f46f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/673/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1013.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/fd4916152066cf69446b0fbd8f7bb3a97a137e13/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0863.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0708","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0777","title":"Microsoft IIS FTP 安全绕过漏洞","description":"IIS（Internet Information Server）及 Commercial Internet System 的 FTP 服务存在权限校验绕过漏洞。由于 FTP 服务器对用户访问权限的处理逻辑存在缺陷，远程攻击者即使被设置为\"无访问权限（No Access）\"，仍可通过构造恶意 FTP 请求绕过权限限制，非法读取或删除服务器上的文件。该漏洞影响运行上述 FTP 服务的 Windows 系统，攻击者可利用匿名或低权限 FTP 连接即可远程发起攻击，无需身份认证，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0777"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:02Z","remediation":"建议升级至 IIS 6.0 或更高版本并安装微软安全补丁 MS99-025；在 IIS 管理器中为 FTP 站点移除匿名用户的\"No Access\"权限，改为显式拒绝访问；若暂无法升级，请在防火墙层面限制 FTP 端口(21/TCP)仅允许受信 IP 访问，并禁用匿名 FTP 登录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ241407","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ242559","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/658","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-039","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8981d7e7baa3f6c5d7a90cd823433b0422b8fcd2/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0777.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0777","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0777.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/94e644a0057439310dc2677c2e4ebd7766be1682/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0777.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qjvq-8mcw-xc4h/GHSA-qjvq-8mcw-xc4h.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0777.yaml","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0777.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0708.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0710","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0908","title":"Sun Solaris TCP Stream Driver 递归 mutex_enter 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7.0 的 TCP 流驱动中存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 nmap OS 指纹识别选项（-O）向开放端口发送恶意连接，当目标服务进程被终止后，TCP 流驱动中的 mutex_enter 函数发生递归调用，导致系统内核崩溃重启。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0908"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至不受影响的版本，或安装 Sun 官方发布的安全补丁，限制对 TCP 端口的未授权访问，使用防火墙过滤恶意连接以防止利用 nmap OS 指纹识别触发递归 mutex_enter 调用导致系统崩溃","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/655","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19507"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0710.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0705","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0705.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0906","title":"S.u.S.E. Linux 6.2 sccw HOME环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"S.u.S.E. Linux 6.2 中的 sccw 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在处理 HOME 环境变量时未对长度进行正确检查，本地攻击者可通过设置过长的 HOME 环境变量触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址，从而获取 root 权限。攻击需要本地用户身份，无需特殊权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0906"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1999-09-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.2 的官方补丁版本，或限制本地用户对 sccw 程序的执行权限。由于该产品已停止支持，建议迁移到受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0906","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19508","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/656"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19508"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19508"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0705.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0519","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0786","title":"Sun Solaris 动态链接器 LD_PROFILE 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 动态链接器存在文件创建漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置 LD_PROFILE 环境变量并结合符号链接攻击，利用动态链接器的权限创建任意文件。该漏洞允许低权限用户以提升的权限在系统任意位置写入文件，可能导致权限提升或系统破坏。攻击需要本地用户身份且对系统有基本访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0786"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-09-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:03Z","remediation":"在 /etc/ld.so.conf 中注释掉 LD_PROFILE 设置，修改 /etc/profile 文件限制 LD_DEBUG 使用，并设置安全环境变量 LD_DEBUG=0 用于限制动态链接器功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/659","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19509","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/abfccbe3a11aa2b9dde2cfba5a12ba6256820a51/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0786.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0786","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0786.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ed6bb242e8dd7e27b54cbf189349b0ad2ae7c304/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0786.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/780ea229276a503f17a45c7ccc9fc5e26e6b2447/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2whr-5263-qqgc/GHSA-2whr-5263-qqgc.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0786.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0786","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0786.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0786","title":"Sun Solaris 动态链接器 LD_PROFILE 本地提权与任意文件创建漏洞","description":"Solaris 动态链接器在处理 LD_PROFILE 环境变量时未对文件路径进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击，诱使动态链接器在特权上下文中向任意路径写入文件，从而实现本地权限提升或破坏系统文件完整性。攻击者需拥有本地系统账户，攻击复杂度低，成功后可能导致敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0786"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Oracle Solaris 11 或更高受支持版本，该漏洞在后续 Solaris 动态链接器实现中已被修复。对于仍运行 Solaris 2.x 的系统，建议迁移至现代受支持版本并应用所有可用安全补丁，同时限制普通用户对 LD_PROFILE 等敏感环境变量的使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/659"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0786.toml"}]